      <h2>Rene Garcia</h2>
      <p class="profile-role">Owner · Oaktree Landscaping · Bluffton, SC</p>
      <p>As the owner of Oaktree Landscaping, a commercial and residential landscaping company in Bluffton, South Carolina, my philosophy remains simple: every project is a testament to the art of superior landscaping.</p>
      <p>Our goal is to exceed expectations not only through the beauty of the finished work, but also through exceptional service, genuine respect for our customers, and appreciation for the environment we live in. My commitment is unwavering: creating lasting beauty, one landscape at a time.</p>
