<section class="section section-tint">
  <div class="container story-grid">
    <div class="sticky-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our History</p>
      <h2>One truck, one yard, and a dedication to quality.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="story-copy prose">
      <p>In the heart of the South Carolina Lowcountry, Oaktree Landscaping began its journey in Beaufort with little more than one truck and a dedication to quality residential care. Founded by Rene in 2018, the company built its reputation one yard at a time.</p>
      <p>By mastering the unique challenges of Lowcountry soil and climate, Oaktree offered personalized services that transformed residential properties into lush, sustainable sanctuaries. A hands-on approach and meticulous attention to detail quickly fostered a loyal clientele.</p>
      <p>As that reputation flourished through word of mouth, Oaktree expanded to meet the region’s growing commercial needs—from banks and plazas to business parks. Even as projects grew more complex, the company stayed true to its founding principles of reliability and aesthetic excellence.</p>
      <p>Today, we deliver sustainable landscape care throughout Bluffton, Beaufort, and Hardeeville, helping every green space—whether a private residence or commercial plaza—flourish in harmony with the community it serves.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

